   Before toolchains

   kit needs bash, git, jq, and yq before it can look for a toolchain.

   ✅ bash 5.2 runs kit
   ❌ jq is not installed · later
      brew install jq
 ▸ ❌ brew is installed but not on PATH
      eval "$(/opt/homebrew/bin/brew shellenv)"
      add it to your shell profile to keep it

   Left for later
   • jq is not installed: brew install jq












